Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're dashing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't\Nbacking down so long as I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark is the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fierce is the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At Onikachiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the dragon roars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The howling beasts sing. Feasting merrily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath the autumn leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams become reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At Habu Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The bold take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The retainers of Kozuki Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Returned at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To battle they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A story of true loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,please allow me to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tell this tale modestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our story begins on a dark,\Nstormy night not long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One day before this year's Fire Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, not far from\Nthe flower capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke and his friends\Nhead toward Tokage Port?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping to catch Luffy before he sets sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've changed your\Nmind about going to sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've already told Luffy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly want to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, it's\Nreassuring to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we last spoke, you told me that\Nyou had come to an important decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Odin started his journey\Nby traveling across Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even done that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I decided to follow his path properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out to see when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, but I can't believe Luffy\Ndiscussed his departure with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or more specifically, I can't believe\Nhe failed to discuss it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's leaving without saying\Ngoodbye to me and Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father was a fool of a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you here? Oh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm gonna be king\Nof the pirates someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the\Npirates someday! Ha! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be the Shogun of Wado someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be like a worm beneath my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a worm or an eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a monkey, you saint!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A figurehead, huh, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gonna cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to vanquish Emmerichino!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's team up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Moffey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a little crybaby\Nwith a dumb top knot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, and you know it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find a way to survive, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang on, and we'll come rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, brat, one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kozuki Morinoste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall become the Shogun\Nof the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With your eyes open this time, I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to stop Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Kaido, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had our share of quarrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But does our adventure\Ntogether mean nothing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a limit to how much\Nboorishness I can tolerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're confusing personal\Nfreedom with disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Tinemon? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't mind, I must ask,\Nwhy do you run when you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for my insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Sir Luffy must answer\Nfor disrespecting our Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If he cannot explain his vile actions\Nto us, we shall consider him an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is the way of samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that it is you who\Ntrampled on our friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, He saved the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.07,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will strike him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then fight him, and then make him pay\Nin whatever manner I deem most suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're enemies\Nthe next time I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to be friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you might end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you around, Jaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here to send you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking running\Noff without saying a word to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon and I have known you for longer\Nthan anyone else in Wano you scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have deeply offended the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You better have a good excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're seeing me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order from the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.62,0:09:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with all of you. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can make it without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the reason I was able to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me the strength to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You all were the reason I\Nwas able to smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for avenging\Nmy father and mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my country
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a fool So I struggle\Nto put this into words
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear what is to come\NI need you here with me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not very Shogun-like. He's\Nstill a kid. Give him a break
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were waiting on the Sunny\Nso we could give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't Shoguns order me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You got bigger, but I\Nknow you're still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're also a dumb little scaredy-cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know you're like\Na little brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this your flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If things get tough we've\Nstill got your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly that flag to send a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If bad guys see that it'll send a packet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Messing with our friend means?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's messing with us, and the Straw Hat\NPirates don't back down from a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinema! Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, if you guys want to become pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll come and pick you up anytime,\Nbut not if you're just going to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yama 2, stay tuned!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it super proud! We shall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me proud out there, show god!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck for my new stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go easy on the crying\Nand you'll do just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to have fun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So take care until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will grow stronger each day\Ntill I surpass Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll make him proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Surpass me! Will you stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, to Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their official port.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a lift there to\Nlower our ship to sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not care for the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My bones were quaking\Njust thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatch, where are\Nyou and Trafalgar off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to use the\Nofficial port to leave water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice and peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good choice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Average pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame you one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta stay safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Should take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like that look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The official port is there for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell and back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an enabler, Beppo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Bay, let me take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke's allies flew into\Nbattle like gods of vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tearing through lesser foes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,they reached to the sky where they\Nfaced the Dragon King Kaido himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A monstrous Oiran stood beside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But even with her aid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the dragon could not\Nwithstand the winds of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,change that blew at the\Nbacks of our heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But nearby, despite being burned,\NOrochi had not met his end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brimming with contempt, he targeted our\Nprincess Hiyori, who stood her ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then whoosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The vile serpent was felled\Nin one cut! But by who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Lord Odin's loyal retainer, Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Odinji's final head was set ablaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy of the Kozuki clan\Npaid for his treachery at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder roared!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido and Onigashima\Nitself were next to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For twenty years, dark clouds\Nhad covered the land of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,blackening the entire realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, suddenly, the\Nclouds began to clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the flower capital,\Nthe festival carried on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Its lively music floated\Ninto the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the snake lived, even\Nsevered from its neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The head of Oruji glared with spite,\Nand from its mouth, a warning came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The grudge of the Kurozumi clan will curse
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano for generations to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your victory is but a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Hiyori stood firm,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,remembering the twenty years of\Nsuffering her people had endured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She returned the serpent's glare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori, stay away, cried Denjiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But she would not be deterred.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brave princess didn't flinch\Nin the face of the serpent's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She delivered his obituary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fan in her hand bore the Kozuki crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.48,0:17:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She bit her lip and counted up the serpent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sins. Father. Mother.\NBrother. I deliver this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,verdict in the name of\Nall my people yeah the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,best part you know the\Nwords all together now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,black charcoal is called Kurozumi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:18:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,because it was born to burn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,twilight songs ring out\Nin the city all night
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,crescent moon in reverse\Nat the port of rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,now the tale is told
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a victory for the brave in\Ngold revenge is had at last
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the time for war and pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,has passed our
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,country is free
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a story that will be\Npassed down for generations
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of those who returned and\Nwho returned peace to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For today, that's all\Nthat has been written.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm certain that\Nthis tale will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will be certain to tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where shall I fly this flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.36,0:20:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who has cried again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What will change?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will turn the light to see the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will turn the light out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be together.
